menu "AIWatchOS"

config AIWATCHOS_MDB_ENABLE
    bool "MDB — Muse Developer Bridge (debug console over USB serial)"
    default y
    help
        The Muse Developer Bridge: a line-based debug console on the
        USB serial port (mdb screenshot / health / logs / touch /
        panic, plus ADB-style input injection — tap, swipe, press,
        goto, wake, sleep, reboot). Protocol: docs/mdb.md.

        ON by default for the hardware bring-up builds. Turn OFF for
        any build that leaves the bench: the console accepts input
        injection from anything that can open the serial port.

endmenu
